{"title": "Create or Destroy Water", "pageid": 2089, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Create_or_Destroy_Water", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Transmutation spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Create_Water.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Create_Water.webp/300px-Create_Water.webp, /w/images/0/0d/Create_Water.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Create_Water.webp/300px-Create_Water.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Create_Water.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Create or Destroy Water </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 transmutation spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to conjure or destroy an area of water (or water-like surfaces).\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nChoose to call forth rain or destroy a water-based surface.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 4 m (13 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 4 m (13 ft) Radius</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Upcasting\" title=\"Upcasting\">Upcasting</a>: When the spell is cast a 2nd Level or higher, the area in which the caster can create or destroy water increases by 2 m (7 ft) for each spell slot level above 1st.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_CreateDestroyWater</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_CreateDestroyWater\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_CreateDestroyWater\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Create_Water\" title=\"Create Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/40px-Create_Water_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/60px-Create_Water_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/80px-Create_Water_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Create Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/40px-Create_Water_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Create_Water\" title=\"Create Water\">Create Water</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_Water\" title=\"Destroy Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Destroy_Water_Icon.webp/40px-Destroy_Water_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Destroy_Water_Icon.webp/60px-Destroy_Water_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Destroy_Water_Icon.webp/80px-Destroy_Water_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Destroy Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Destroy_Water_Icon.webp/40px-Destroy_Water_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Destroy_Water_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_Water\" title=\"Destroy Water\">Destroy Water</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a></li><li> Class level 2: <a href=\"/wiki/Conjuration_School\" title=\"Conjuration School\">Conjuration School</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Minor_Conjuration:_Create_Water\" title=\"Minor Conjuration: Create Water\">Minor Conjuration</a>)</li><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/Storm_Sorcery\" title=\"Storm Sorcery\">Storm Sorcery</a> (Storm Spell)</li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\">Magic Initiate: Cleric</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\">Magic Initiate: Druid</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rain_Dancer\" title=\"Rain Dancer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rain_Dancer\" title=\"Rain Dancer\">Rain Dancer</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wavemother%27s_Robe\" title=\"Wavemother's Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Wavemother%27s_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wavemother%27s_Robe\" title=\"Wavemother's Robe\">Wavemother's Robe</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Create water applies the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a> condition: Vulnerability to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage (double damage).</li>\n<li>Lightning Spells cast on water causes the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocked\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\">Shocked</a> condition: Removing their reaction and having a chance to stun.</li>\n<li>Electrified Water + a Fire Spell causes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Steam\" title=\"Electrified Steam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Steam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Electrified_Steam_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Steam\" title=\"Electrified Steam\">Electrified Steam</a>, which resets the Shocked and Wet conditions.</li>\n<li>A Cold spell freezes the water/mist and creates an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\">Ice</a> surface, causing Difficult Terrain (half Movement Speed) and may cause creatures in the area to fall <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a> unless succeeding a DEX Save. (e.g. Create Water + <a href=\"/wiki/Glyph_of_Warding\" title=\"Glyph of Warding\">Glyph of Warding</a>).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Conjuration_School\" title=\"Conjuration School\">Conjuration School</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> only receive the <a href=\"/wiki/Create_Water\" title=\"Create Water\">Create Water</a> variant of the spell, which can only be cast once per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a> and does not consume a spell slot.</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rain_Dancer\" title=\"Rain Dancer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Magic_Staff_C_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rain_Dancer\" title=\"Rain Dancer\">Rain Dancer</a> only grants the <a href=\"/wiki/Create_Water\" title=\"Create Water\">Create Water</a> variant of the spell.</li>\n<li>A character can only have <em>one</em> version of Create or Destroy Water at a time, even if gained from multiple sources.</li>\n<li>A hidden character that is out-of-combat can cast the <a href=\"/wiki/Create_Water\" title=\"Create Water\">Create Water</a> version of this spell on in-combat characters without using an action. While casting the spell unhides them and likely forces them into combat, the character who created this water will still have an action to use in the first turn of combat, as though they had not cast a spell. This is true even in <a href=\"/wiki/Honour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour\">Honour</a> Mode.</li>\n<li>The incantations for Create Water are <b>Pluo</b> (<i>\"Rain\"</i>) and <b>Aqua pura</b> (<i>\"Pure water\"</i>). The incantations for Destroy Water are <b>Aresce</b> (<i>\"Become dry\"</i>) and <b>Ares decimos</b> (<i>\"Ten times drier\"</i>).</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Create_or_destroy_water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Create or destroy water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Create_or_destroy_water\">Create or destroy water</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034334\nCache expiry: 86400\n